354893_2123985974762689_1544591742969265917_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dqkQUcvsSfIQ7kNvwEgQp9O&_nc_oc=AdqzrB6-jTy7T-LOV08M2oL5VH4DFCuTsHjmhu5r8FTWct216fL9JdkR5ATpthyM7n8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQX7LAWxe6yBtHwoaudM_jpmjG7kxqnGEjqGYv_BSKakg&oe=6AFF2FE3"}, {"file_name": "image4.png", "id": "1479678613042418", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300750_1479678616375751_6997581480530838541_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Zy2vYwMewp4Q7kNvwFT_Hg_&_nc_oc=AdqTXpeT944JhHS5Ib3u0UGHWiA7qeAwlOX8P7HDm6Vud3Dvfsh6B1axCXJg9dFOOPo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQcBcE4vjFlSOCVJMpuv6MrNVICmbKKF34amVpOsKjOIQ&oe=6AFF2EF0"}, {"file_name": "image5.png", "id": "1245528793651676", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499349371_1245528796985009_3447873084062975841_n.png?_nc_cat=111&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Vtzs2GNwi3UQ7kNvwHdvjtK&_nc_oc=AdqkNhwh0nS13U1jOo4uyAlO2dOq4f03cX6v9EJ04Z9o1JgHUUujnmKqrXNXH-XwW-M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSYkEjagk2aLRrP0njXz0X4ke1cJUDGbj_wuCHDz_i5Uw&oe=6AFF2DAD"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Hero360", "keywords": [], "long_description": "HERO 360 is a virtual reality training tool designed to teach people how to evacuate a house safely during a fire\u2014whether or not a smoke alarm is present. The name \u201cHERO\u201d reflects the purpose of the app: to empower users to become their own hero by learning life-saving reflexes and making the right decisions in a high-risk situation. Surviving a fire starts with knowledge and preparation\u2014HERO 360 gives users the chance to practice that before it\u2019s real.", "short_description": "HERO 360 is a virtual reality training tool designed to teach people how to evacuate a house safely dur